WEBVTT

00:02:59.333 --> 00:03:02.934
It's a testament, I think,
to the seductive appeal

00:03:02.958 --> 00:03:06.768
of some powerful figure
offering you easy, simple answers

00:03:06.792 --> 00:03:09.268
to life's complex and subtle questions

00:03:09.292 --> 00:03:10.976
and anxieties.

00:03:11.000 --> 00:03:13.143
So thank you all of you
that wrote questions.

00:03:13.167 --> 00:03:15.726
I haven't seen these.
I know somebody's guarding them.

00:03:15.750 --> 00:03:17.059
Thank you so much.

00:03:17.083 --> 00:03:19.809
I will take those now.
Thank you all of you that did this.

00:03:19.833 --> 00:03:25.726
I should say, probably,
a couple of things before I start.

00:03:25.750 --> 00:03:27.125
In absolute honesty,

00:03:28.042 --> 00:03:30.351
first of all I can't see
through these envelopes.